        <div class="faq-answer">
          <div class="faq-answer-content">
            <p>Correct. Dr. Noot has not placed a single crown in over 18 years of practice. Instead, he uses custom inlays, onlays, and advanced composite techniques that preserve your natural tooth structure and provide superior long-term results.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      
      <div class="faq-item">
        <button class="faq-question">
          Is biomimetic dentistry more expensive?
          <span class="faq-toggle">+</span>
